---
const { id = 'demo' } = Astro.props;
---

<section id={id} class="section sm">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="card cta">
			<div>
				<div class="pill">金融内容落地页 · Astro</div>
				<h2 class="h2">把数据呈现与内容营销统一到一个高性能站点</h2>
				<p class="muted">
					先用静态落地页打磨信息架构与品牌表达，后续再无缝扩展到行情组件、博客、研究报告与订阅体系。
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="actions">
				<a class="btn primary" href="mailto:hello@example.com">预约演示</a>
				<a class="btn" href="#features">查看能力</a>
			</div>
			<div class="fine">
				风险提示：本页面为模板示例，不构成任何投资建议。上线前请按业务与监管要求补齐披露信息。
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.cta {
		padding: 22px;
		border-radius: 24px;
		background: radial-gradient(900px 300px at 20% 20%, rgba(76, 201, 240, 0.18), transparent 60%),
			radial-gradient(900px 300px at 75% 0%, rgba(161, 255, 206, 0.14), transparent 60%),
			linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05));
	}

	.cta > div {
		max-width: 74ch;
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 10px;
		margin-top: 18px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.fine {
		margin-top: 18px;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.54);
		font-size: 12px;
		line-height: 1.6;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		padding-top: 14px;
	}
</style>

